{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RushCountdown 是一款為分秒必爭場合而設的倒數計時工具，無論是搶演唱會門票、參與限時閃購，還是等待產品開賣，都能讓你時刻掌握剩餘時間。程式支援設定目標時間、透過網絡時間校正，並可啟動子母畫面倒數，切換其他應用程式時仍然保持可見。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>懸浮倒數計時隨時保持可見</h2>\n<p>設定目標時間十分簡單，計時器顯示到十分之一秒，同時列出當前時間，介面保持簡潔。程式支援子母畫面倒數，切換應用程式時依然可見，並可透過網絡時間校正，必要時自動改用備用時間來源。內置多種顯示語言，適合搶票、閃購及產品開賣等分秒必爭的場合。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-346-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-347-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-348-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-349-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-350-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-351-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RushCountdown</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T10:58:14.612834+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}